# Calculator

Ek simple web-based calculator, HTML/CSS/JS se bana hua.

## Live Demo
Deploy karne ke baad yahan link daalo:
`https://officialabhinaw.github.io/calculator`

## Features
- Basic operations: `+`, `-`, `*`, `/`
- `AC` — sab clear
- `back` — last character delete
- `%` — percentage
- Circular button design, mobile-responsive

## Tech
- HTML
- CSS (Flexbox)
- Vanilla JavaScript

## Run Locally
Bas `index.html` ko browser me kholo, ya VS Code Live Server use karo.